---
const { pathname } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="comments-section">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">DISCUSSION</div>
  <h2>留言讨论</h2>
  <p>留言通过 GitHub Issues 维护。首次使用时，GitHub 可能会要求授权 Utterances 应用访问此公开仓库。</p>
  <script src="https://utteranc.es/client.js"
    repo="d49229815-art/my-blog"
    issue-term={pathname}
    label="blog-comment"
    theme="github-light"
    crossorigin="anonymous"
    async>
  </script>
</section>
